    "### Chart 2: Annual GHI Trend and Change from Baseline by Zone\n",
    "Left panel shows absolute GHI by zone over time. Right panel shows percentage\n",
    "change from the 2005 baseline, with linear regression trend lines and the\n",
    "2015-2021 trough period shaded."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "a517165d-9df7-4436-b671-58cc3388a4bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
