    "**Trough risk scoring : all-Low is a methodology artifact**\n",
    "Trough risk scoring uses the 19-year mean as the threshold denominator. The mean includes trough years (2015-2021), so the threshold understates sustained underperformance. A pre-trough baseline (2005-2014) produces more conservative tier assignments, as shown in Phase 2d below."
