    "### Forward Resource Scenarios: Base, Downside, and Stress\n",
    "Three resource cases expressed as a percentage of the long-run mean: a base case\n",
    "drawn from the 2022-2023 recovery years, a downside case drawn from the\n",
    "2015-2021 trough, and a stress case extrapolated forward by linear regression.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "The stress case uses linear regression extrapolated to 2038 as an illustrative sensitivity, not a forecast. The observation window (19 years) contains a trough-and-recovery cycle that means a linear fit will underestimate future GHI in recovery-phase years and overestimate it in trough-phase years. Treat the stress case as a bounding scenario for lender sensitivity analysis, not a prediction of resource trajectory."
   ]
