    "### DSCR Results Export \n",
    "Recomputes every DSCR scenario and grid combination independently and\n",
    "writes a flat, long-format table. This is the source file for the SQL\n",
    "fact and dimension tables and for the Tableau and Power BI DSCR views\n",
    "built on top of this analysis."
